From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:40:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] po: the notices of a 3D video shown flat or at reduced width
 in the languages of Sparky Stereo OS

The titles and the texts of the two dialogs that 3d-0047 shows when the
desktop does not take the stereo declaration of the video window (3D video
shown flat) or does not place the views of a video window one by one (3D
video shown at reduced width), in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French,
German, Japanese, Korean and Simplified and Traditional Chinese. The Korean and
Polish reduced-width strings follow the review of ORDER 440 (a view is one
eye's picture: 시점 영상; Polish: ze zmniejszoną szerokością).

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
---
--- a/po/de.po
+++ b/po/de.po
@@ -30151,3 +30151,30 @@
 #: modules/gui/qt/menus.cpp
 msgid "Swap left and right eyes"
 msgstr "Linkes und rechtes Auge vertauschen"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid "3D video shown flat"
+msgstr "3D-Video flach angezeigt"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid ""
+"The desktop does not take stereo video windows (Stereo KWin does), so "
+"this 3D video is not shown in 3D. VLC's messages say why."
+msgstr ""
+"Der Desktop nimmt keine stereoskopischen Videofenster an (Stereo KWin "
+"tut es), daher wird dieses 3D-Video nicht in 3D gezeigt. Die Meldungen "
+"von VLC nennen den Grund."
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid "3D video shown at reduced width"
+msgstr "3D-Video mit verringerter Breite angezeigt"
+
+#: modules/video_output/opengl/display.c
+msgid ""
+"The desktop does not place a video window's views one by one (Stereo "
+"KWin does), so each view of this 3D video is shown at half its width. "
+"VLC's messages say why."
+msgstr ""
+"Der Desktop platziert die Ansichten eines Videofensters nicht einzeln "
+"(Stereo KWin tut es), daher wird jede Ansicht dieses 3D-Videos nur mit "
+"halber Breite gezeigt. Die Meldungen von VLC nennen den Grund."
--- a/po/fr.po
+++ b/po/fr.po
@@ -30079,3 +30079,30 @@
